        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9om5vj-qfbonkk",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the port. The ferry to Colonia del Sacramento departs at 08:15. The crossing takes about 1 hour 15 minutes, with arrival at around 09:30.\n\nColonia del Sacramento was founded by the Portuguese in the 17th century. Its historic quarter is a UNESCO World Heritage Site.\n\nDuring the visit, you can walk along cobbled streets, climb the lighthouse for views of the Río de la Plata and buy local souvenirs.\n\nLunch in the main square is not included. After some free time, transfer to Montevideo and check in for a two-night stay."
    },
